category.description:
Sub-type within the layer. Values by layer:
road_incident `incident` (CHP) | `closure` (Caltrans planned lane closure);
chain_control `r1` | `r2` | `r3` (a stretch) | `closed` (absent on a truck or hold level);
message_sign `message` | `blank` | `unknown`;
weather_alert the NWS event name (`Heat Advisory`, `Red Flag Warning`);
fire_weather banner `normal` | `elevated` | `red-flag` (absent on forecast points);
wildfire `wildfire`; evacuation the lowercase level (`order`, `warning`, …);
power `unplanned` | `planned` | `psps`;
mesh_node the node type `repeater` | `companion` | `room_server` | `sensor`.
Absent on road_segment, camera and mesh_link edges.

coordinates.description:
Nesting depends on `type`:
Point `[lng, lat]`;
MultiPoint and LineString `[[lng, lat], ...]` (a LineString has 2+);
MultiLineString and Polygon `[[[lng, lat], ...], ...]` (a Polygon's
first ring is the exterior; every ring closes on its first position);
MultiPolygon `[[[[lng, lat], ...], ...], ...]`.
